            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a processor of a serving cell configured to perform operations comprising: generating a measurement configuration comprising an event configuration associated with radio resource management, RRM, relaxation; transmitting the measurement configuration to a user equipment, UE; receiving a measurement report from the UE; and transmitting an indication to the UE that RRM relaxation for radio resource control, RRC, connected mode is enabled at the UE.</p>
            </abstract>
